{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1793762225364, "sessionID": "ses_e5b70be9effet5aw3oRkwRDZOZ", "part": {"id": "prt_1a48f62fb001FKrUzl7dIv2MG3", "messageID": "msg_1a48f5cdb001njnIZaHyJh1iaU", "sessionID": "ses_e5b70be9effet5aw3oRkwRDZOZ", "type": "text", "text": "AuditService depends on **UserService** for identity resolution. UserService, in turn, uses **UsersPostgresDatabase**.\n\nThe dependency chain is:\n\n`AuditService \u2192 UserService \u2192 UsersPostgresDatabase`\n\nUserService\u2019s read replica is configured by **`ORDER_DB_URL`**. Despite its name, this key configures UserService; the historical name is retained because three deployment scripts read it.\n\nNo separate identity-resolution API or configuration key for AuditService is recorded in the graph. AuditService also stores data in **AuditIcebergTable**, but that is a storage dependency rather than part of the recorded identity-resolution chain.", "time": {"start": 1793762222843, "end": 1793762225362}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_058a024d70c7c36c016aeaa3aeca8887d1a8d39d3c7e461bbd", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
